<title>SINGAPORE: Omni Mold half-year net up 23 percent.</title>
<headline>Omni Mold half-year net up 23 percent.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    0.59   vs    0.48</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		   0.83   vs    0.68</p>
<p>    Turnover				9.27   vs    6.54</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		  0.16   vs    0.09</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	    0.81   vs    0.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			0.59   vs    0.48</p>
<p>    Tax					-     vs     -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries			-     vs    0.35</p>
<p>Note - Omni Mold Ltd said it expects to maintain a satisfactory performance in the second half of the year.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
